<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE PROMOTION PLAY-OFF MATCHES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE PROMOTION PLAY-OFF MATCHES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal schedule for English</p>
<p>league promotion play-off matches:</p>
<p>Division one (for promotion to premier league)</p>
<p> Crystal Palace   v Wolverhampton</p>
<p> Sheffield United v Ipswich     </p>
<p>Division two (for promotion to division one)</p>
<p> Crewe		v Luton	 </p>
<p> Bristol City     v Brentford   </p>
<p>Division three (for promotion to division two)</p>
<p> Cardiff	    v Northampton </p>
<p> Chester	    v Swansea     </p>
<p>First legs May 11, second legs May 14.</p>
<p>Dates of finals (to be played at Wembley):</p>
<p>May 24 - division three</p>
<p>May 25 - division two</p>
<p>May 26 - division one</p>
